ex it may compact from a value the node computes for itself (trim from the minimum recorded accepted index, the snapshot call from the receiving node's decided index) and neither compares that bound with the entries the log actually holds. The fact cites the derivations and the two receipts that exercised it (trim compacting 7 and the snapshot call compacting 8, both over logs of six indices), which are the same receipts the child accounts rest on.\\\"),\n \\\"knowledge\\\":[k]}\njson.dump(up, open('update.json','w'), indent=1); print('written')\nPY\ntimeout 45 /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-16_09-22-17-omnipaxos-real-run --submission update.json 2>&1 | head -c 300\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
